(29, '/uploads/local/image-1767007172893-555410601.jpg', 'एनपीएल ट्रफीसहित लुम्बिनी लायन्स तानेसनमा [तस्बिरहरू]', 'एनपीएल ट्रफीसहित लुम्बिनी लायन्स तानेसनमा [तस्बिरहरू]', '2025-12-29 11:19:00', 'kan', NULL, '2025-12-29 11:19:32', '2025-12-29 11:19:32', '<div class=\"article-header\" style=\"font-size: 1.15em; border-bottom-style: initial; color: rgb(42, 42, 42); font-family: Mukta, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;\"><div class=\"a-inner-header\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"Ai-summary\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><ul><li style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 20px; width: 635.8px;\">तानसेन नगरपालिका, जिल्ला क्रिकेट संघ, खेलाडी, होटल व्यवसायीलगायतले लुम्बिनी लायन्सलाई स्वागत गरेका हुन् ।</li></ul></div><div class=\"details-meta\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: left; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span class=\"detail-date\" style=\"line-height: 1; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 16px; text-align: center; display: block;\">पुस १४, २०८२</span><div class=\"author\" style=\"font-size: 15.3px; line-height: 1; color: rgb(90, 90, 90); padding-left: 15px; margin-left: 15px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><a href=\"https://ekantipur.com/author/author-8915\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); transition: 0.3s ease-in; font-size: 18px;\">माधव अर्याल</a></div></div></div><div class=\"a-title-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"image\" style=\"position: relative;\"><figure style=\"margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; width: 748px; height: 508.688px;\"><img class=\"image-caption image-9827935\" data-path=\"news/kantipur/2025/sports/npl-tropphy-palpa-16-29122025095117.jpg\" alt=\"Lumbini Lions at the stadium with the NPL trophy [Photos]\" src=\"https://assets-cdn-api.ekantipur.com/thumb.php?src=https://assets-cdn.ekantipur.com/uploads/source/news/kantipur/2025/sports/npl-tropphy-palpa-16-29122025095117-1000x0.jpg&amp;w=1001&amp;h=0\"></figure></div><div class=\"samsung_banner_wrapper\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 748px; padding-left: 20px;\"></div></div><div class=\"share-section-wrapper\" style=\"padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-top: 4px; position: relative; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-radius: 8px;\"><div class=\"share-section\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; position: relative; margin-top: 10px;\"><div class=\"share-left\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><a href=\"https://ekantipur.com/sports/2025/12/29/en/lumbini-lions-at-the-stadium-with-the-npl-trophy-photos-47-49.html\" class=\"share-article-btn\" style=\"cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(50, 108, 172); transition: 0.3s ease-in; padding: 12px 14px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-radius: 4px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; line-height: 1;\">Read in English</a></div><div class=\"share-right detail-icon-save meta-links\" style=\"display: flex !important; column-gap: 12px !important; align-items: center !important; margin-left: auto !important;\"><div class=\"share-wrapper\"><a id=\"share-article-btn\" style=\"cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); transition: 0.3s ease-in; font-size: 12.5px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; float: left; background: rgb(232, 232, 232); width: auto; height: 40px; border-radius: 4px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px;\"><svg viewBox